            & "upward for well over 100 feet.  Suspended from some unseen point far\n"
            & "above you, an enormous two-sided mirror is hanging parallel to and\n"
            & "midway between the canyon walls.  (The mirror is obviously\n"
            & "provided for the use of the curmudgeons who, as you know, are\n"
            & "extremely vain.)  A small window can be seen in either wall, some\n"
            & "fifty feet up.",
          "You're in Mirror Canyon.",
          { "DEEP" },
          173, False, { 9 }),

      Rem 110  LOC_WINDOW2  DEEP
